    <briefdescription>
<para>Concrete implementation of a pure data dependence graph builder. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides custom implementation for the pure-virtual functions used in the generic dependence graph build algorithm.</para>
<para>For information about time complexity of the build algorithm see the comments near the declaration of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_abstract_dependence_graph_builder" kindref="compound">AbstractDependenceGraphBuilder</ref>. </para>
